      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5efb35af0823040",
      "translationZh": "我想分享一则简短更新和一段性能演示视频，展示在我的 16x GB10 集群上运行完整的 Moonshot AI Kimi K3（moonshotai/Kimi-K3）模型的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df361a9001efc735",
      "translationZh": "要让一个拥有 2.8T 参数的模型流畅运行，需要定制的运行时补丁和扎实的网络布局，不过它在编程任务上的吞吐量和并发能力令人印象深刻。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a2b0fbac0c39079",
      "translationZh": "代码生成 / 解码：在繁重的代码生成和智能体任务中，持续保持约 30 tok/s（峰值约为 38 tok/s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e55ccd8edda390ab",
      "translationZh": "预填充吞吐量：约 750–910 tok/s（通过修改后的 NCCL 拓扑和双交换机配置进行优化）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e650030ca250a2f",
      "translationZh": "并发与压力测试：能够流畅处理多个并发用户请求，既不会降低 token 生成速率，也不会造成 KV 缓存内存不足。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2dc28a234b846cc5",
      "translationZh": "上下文 / 工具基准测试：在数十万 token 的上下文下稳定运行智能体工作流，并进行多次 500k 上下文压缩。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d53d83ff429f0bb",
      "translationZh": "计算资源：16x GB10 集群节点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9ebb7282e779893",
      "translationZh": "连接配置：双 MikroTik 交换机（CRS804-4DDQ），使用 4x 400G-to-4x100G 分支线缆。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be94e9cf598512a0",
      "translationZh": "运行时：定制的 gb10-vllm 技术栈，使用 dspark / Inferact/Kimi-K3-DSpark 封装，并配有自定义 MLA/KV 内核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "250e6225afe9ae2a",
      "translationZh": "我附上了一段短视频，展示实时 token 流式输出和代码输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
